title <size:20><b>Image Solve Platform Flow Routes</b></size>\n<size:12>Overview of Message Processing and Purchase Workflows</size>

class "Flow Route 1\nEmail → Item → BuyOffer" as Route1 #SUCCESS {
  + Entry Point: Outlook Email
